    <item>
      <title>VMware Certified Professional – VMware Cloud (Gratuita)</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 11 Dec 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/images/vcp-vmc.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;291&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;291&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/images/vcp-vmc.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/images/vcp-vmc.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/images/vcp-vmc.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/vmware-certified-professional--vmware-cloud-gratuita/images/vcp-vmc.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Recentemente a VMware anunciou sua nova certificação, a &lt;strong&gt;VMware Certified Professional – VMware Cloud (VCP–VMC) 2022&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Essa certificação valida a capacidade de identificar os principais componentes de uma solução VMware em Cloud, como se conectar e migrar para VMware Cloud, os benefícios do VMware Tanzu Kubernetes Grid.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Instalação e Configuração do MinIO</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 21 Sep 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <author>eurodrigolira@gmail.com (Rodrigo Lira)</author>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/images/MINIO_wordmark.png&#34; &gt;&lt;figure&gt;&lt;img&#xA;    class=&#34;my-0 rounded-md&#34;&#xA;    loading=&#34;lazy&#34;&#xA;    decoding=&#34;async&#34;&#xA;    fetchpriority=&#34;auto&#34;&#xA;    alt=&#34;&#34;&#xA;    width=&#34;1024&#34;&#xA;    height=&#34;154&#34;&#xA;    src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/images/MINIO_wordmark-1024x154_hu_397485e00be35d88.png&#34;&#xA;    srcset=&#34;http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/images/MINIO_wordmark-1024x154_hu_397485e00be35d88.png 800w, http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/images/MINIO_wordmark-1024x154.png 1280w&#34;&#xA;    sizes=&#34;(min-width: 768px) 50vw, 65vw&#34;&#xA;    data-zoom-src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/instala%C3%A7%C3%A3o-e-configura%C3%A7%C3%A3o-do-minio/images/MINIO_wordmark-1024x154.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Salve Salve Pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Hoje vamos ver como podemos instalar e configurar o &lt;strong&gt;MinIO&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;O &lt;strong&gt;MinIO&lt;/strong&gt; é um sistema de armazenamento do tipo &lt;strong&gt;object storage&lt;/strong&gt;, compatível com as features de &lt;strong&gt;API&lt;/strong&gt; do &lt;strong&gt;S3&lt;/strong&gt; da &lt;strong&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
